hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,arabic,grades,reference,international_number,narrator_chain,chapter_intro}:
"124","لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا أنْـت سُـبْحانَكَ إِنِّي كُنْـتُ مِنَ الظّـالِميـن","","","","","When in fear of afflicting something with an (evil) eye from oneself"
"125","اللهُ اللهُ رَبِّي لا أُشْـرِكُ بِهِ شَيْـئاً","","","","","When startled"
